UID:6cf8258eb149c003982fee4a9513720d@songbyrddc.com
DESCRIPTION:Thursday August 27th Hit Shuffle: A Live Show by Kontra \\*\\*
 \\* Father Sokka is a Washington\, D.C. born\, Baltimore-based artist push
 ing the boundaries of modern alternative music. Blending the energy of pun
 k and rock with the lyricism and intentionalism of rap\, Father Sokka has 
 carved out a sound that’s both rebellious and deeply personal. Backed by
  their live band T.A.T.\, every performance delivers a high-energy\, emoti
 onally charged experience that leaves a lasting impression. As one of the 
 east coast’s most exciting emerging artists\, Father Sokka is quickly es
 tablishing themself as a superstar to watch. \\*\\*\\* O.K. also known as 
 Organized Khaos is multifaceted alternative soul artist and rapper who is 
 native to PG County\, MD. Her name is Organized Khaos and her art style is
  just that. She is a Singer-songwriter\, visual artist\, actress\, author\
 , & poet who can never be defined by societal expectations. As a young bla
 ck woman with ADHD and Autism\, she wants to let her listeners know that t
 hey will always be O.K. in her eyes. #iamok \\*\\*\\* Risk is a Virginia
 –born-and-raised multidisciplinary artist working across traditional art
 \, music\, and film. Their work explores emotional honesty\, memory\, inte
 rnet-age intimacy\, and the quiet absurdity of being human\, often blendin
 g sincerity with humor to invite connection. A bit of a chameleon\, she’
 s in constant pursuit of building the community she never found growing up
 — one where you can be yourself completely and be seen and loved for it.
  \\*\\*\\* Elyvn makes alternative bedroom pop and r&b. I’m a Christian 
 artist\, taking over non Christian spaces. She’s just making music to ma
 ke you feel something.
