UID:5d66596ca65063201cb70019d483ae20@songbyrddc.com
DESCRIPTION:Saturday October 24th Songbyrd x U+N Booking Present Swapmeet 
 is a 4-piece band from South Australia composed of Venus O’Broin (guitar
 \, vocals)\, Joshua Doherty (bass)\, Maxwell Elphick (guitar\, drums\, voc
 als)\, and Jack Medlyn (guitar\, drums\, vocals). Having recently caught t
 he ear of American indie label Winspear\, the band is readying their debut
  album and offering a taste of the new material with “I Know!”\, a cat
 hartic and buoyant debut single for their new label home. Revved up with g
 leaming\, fuzzy guitars and energetic percussion\, the new track blurs jan
 gle pop\, shoegaze\, and alt-rock with tongue-in-cheek precision. The grou
 p met as teenagers in the early 2020s while playing in various projects ar
 ound the Adelaide music scene and bonded over their love of 90s alternativ
 e\, citing Pavement and Sonic Youth as early influences. They soon started
  writing music together and released their debut single in late 2023 and q
 uickly returned with their debut EP\, Oxalis\, in mid-2024. The EP was wel
 l received\, earning nods from Rolling Stone Australia and Triple J\, and 
 the band was soon moving out of local pub gigs and into big clubs\, openin
 g for international touring artists across the whole of Australia\, and re
 cently won the Emerging Artist & Best Performance award at SXSW Sydney for
  their charismatic live show.
LOCATION:Songbyrd\, 540 Penn St NE\, Washington\, DC 20002\, USA
