UID:a9ca0f6526abd90b836df193bd571c34@songbyrddc.com
DESCRIPTION:Sunday August 30th \\*SunDAY Finale\\*\\*12 pm start\\* Celebr
 ate the 25th Anniversary of Res' classic album "How I Do" with Res live at
  Songbyrd! Res epitomizes the archetype of an artist rebelling against the
  confines of traditional industry boxes\, effortlessly carving out a niche
  that is distinctively her own. Her debut album\, How I Do\, has been immo
 rtalized as a cult classic\, while its successor\, the independently relea
 sed Black Girls Rock\, unveils Res as an artist exploring and expressing h
 er authentic voice. The hit track from this release\, For Who You Are\, ha
 s remarkably amassed over 10 million YouTube streams. Penned by Res and co
 -produced with her late mentor\, Wah Wah Watson\, it echoes her indomitabl
 e spirit and drive. Her subsequent release\, Refried Mac\, is a heartfelt 
 tribute to Fleetwood Mac and has been met with equal acclaim. As a solo ar
 tist touring globally\, and as a backing vocalist for the legendary superg
 roup Gnarls Barkley during their St. Elsewhere debut album tour\, Res has 
 steadfastly cemented herself as a dynamic force in both live performances 
 and studio recordings.
